  (text
    "1. Function: Convert VDCIN to nominal 3.3 V for the selected LDO A assembly. C47/C48 bypass VIN; L14/C49/C50 filter output; R77/R78/C54 set feedback;"
    (at 303.5 441 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "9d238864-cdd4-5d91-8081-0801a7335709"))
  (text
    "C53/C55/C56 provide bootstrap/soft-start/bias. SGND_BUCK joins R78/C55/U10.4 to DGND only at copper NT1. No separate stimulation converters are provided."
    (at 303.5 444.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "a4da662a-0472-576d-9f1f-a10a0149a85b"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Adapted BRK8305 A03 main sheet1 (PDFp1), U10 converter: https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3 . Inherited"
    (at 303.5 451.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "ebf20bf7-69a3-5294-bf0f-753d515e025a"))
  (text
    "Codex adaptation fits R75=10k (source DNP), omits R76=0 ohm, R1/S1 control and PG pullup R79. R77=73.2k, R78=22.1k, C54=10pF, C55=3.3nF, C53=100nF,"
    (at 303.5 454.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "eebae6cc-a8b1-5b76-83f2-1263b5fc94ae"))
  (text
    "C47=22uF, C48=100nF, C49=C50=22uF and L14=3.3uH remain. V33 Codex creates local quiet net SGND_BUCK and copper-only NT1 (not a fitted resistor); the ERC"
    (at 303.5 458 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "1f398fbb-f43d-575c-9d94-c662394e5165"))
  (text
    "flag asserts its DGND feed and adds no hardware. TI TPS54429E SLVSAS0 (Feb2011), p5 RSA pin map and p16 items4/8/11: https://www.ti.com/lit/gpn/TPS54429E ."
    (at 303.5 461.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "0ce95db6-b2c2-5c82-8661-e452e4f78f45"))
  (text
    "This is a Codex local implementation of TI single-point SGND/PGND guidance, not a copied RSA layout. C56 changes from LMK105BJ105KV-F 1uF/10V 0402 to Taiyo"
    (at 303.5 464.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "5ba7aa18-113a-5b9e-8490-b5a2e44cc9d8"))
  (text
    "MSAST168SB7105KTNA01 1uF/25V X7R 0603. It adapts TI EVM SLVU444A (Aug2021), p18 Table7-1 C6 (1uF/16V X7R 0603) to a higher-voltage exact part:"
    (at 303.5 468.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "18676293-2d4d-5e35-8e97-1d0ed6c401df"))
  (text
    "https://www.ti.com/lit/ug/slvu444a/slvu444a.pdf ; https://ds.yuden.co.jp/TYCOMPAS/ut/detail?pn=MSAST168SB7105KTNA01&u=M . Original Source_MPN is retained;"
    (at 303.5 471.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "97950187-0d0d-542c-a3ae-ffb5be3be434"))
  (text
    "this is a replacement, not a renamed part. L14 differs from TI pp13-14/Table1 3.3V row (2.2uH). Loop/startup/ripple/thermal performance remains unverified."
    (at 303.5 475 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "7f63fd15-cc16-5298-9748-2572e03a0e78"))
  (text
    "Howard selected LDO A, Downloads folder ending \" 2\", on 17Oct2026. Its separate J15 INPUT_VDD10, J8 INPUT_VSS10 and AGND connections remain system"
    (at 303.5 478.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "8aa933c1-e75b-53f1-b71b-1bdd33c32717"))
  (text
    "requirements; 3.3V-only stimulation is unverified."
    (at 303.5 481.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left))
    (uuid "4fd1362a-b652-58e6-bbb4-09002037402e"))
