  (global_label
    "DGND"
    (shape passive)
    (at 133.35 816.61 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "c31b2a15-3bea-4a51-bd81-0d32bea323f5"))
  (text
    "1. Function: Receive USB VBUS and D+/D-; R500/R501 identify a sink. D500 protects D+/D-;\nD501 is a separate VBUS TVS. C510 bypasses VBUS; C522/FB503 return the shield to DGND."
    (at 158.5 815 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f42958d4-14d4-4adc-abfe-ec701e84f8ef"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Inherited BRK8305 A03 JTAG sheet 8 (PDF p4), adapted by Codex:\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3\nJ500 changed from USB4120-03-C to horizontal USB4110-GF-A. R500=R501=5.1k, C510=10nF,\nC522=100nF and FB503=220 ohm @100MHz retained. Source DNP R504/R505/R506 (0 ohm\nshield bypasses) and J501 omitted; shield remains on its own net.\nV39: D500 pins 2/9 disconnected from VBUS and explicitly NC; D+/D- protection unchanged.\nCodex added D501 TPD1E10B06DPYR from VBUS to DGND using TI application guidance.\nThis is a carrier adaptation, not an unchanged manufacturer reference circuit.\nDiodes D5V0FS4U10LP, DS39520 Rev1-2 (Sep2017), pp1-2: pin map / holding ratings.\nhttps://www.diodes.com/datasheet/download/D5V0FS4U10LP.pdf\nTI TPD1E10B06, SLLSEB1G (Aug2024), pp3-5,8,11: pins, ratings, mode and layout;\nDPY0002A drawing 4224561/C (Jul2024): 0.3x0.5mm lands, 0.7mm pitch.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd1e10b06.pdf\nD501 removes the VBUS connection to D500's low-holding channel; this is not ESD qualification.\nTVS clamp can exceed C511 6.3V and U501 VREGIN 5.5V operating limits; FB502 attenuation\nand VREGIN transient withstand need manufacturer guidance and bench validation.\nUSB enumeration/EMC remain unverified.\nV41: C510 changes KEMET C0402C103K4RACTU to Samsung CL05B103KB5NNNC.\nSame 10nF/10% X7R/0402; rating 16V to 50V. Samsung product sheet, Size/Characteristics:\nhttps://product.samsungsem.com/mlcc/CL05B103KB5NNN.do (accessed 18Oct2026)."
    (at 158.5 827 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "32f9ae09-4c16-4e8d-905d-e9f10c32025b"))

  (text "Pad centers, pitch and nets are retained; two adjacent vias move +0.30 mm X and four straight power spurs extend." (at 563.5 255.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "4b0acf5f-28dd-44ed-95c0-9b9cc470fb7a"))

